#40, flavor, glycerin, high fructose corn syrup, microcrystalline cellulose and<br/>
carboxymethylcellulose sodium, propylene glycol, purified water, sodium<br/>
benzoate, sorbitol solution, sucralose, xanthan gum</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20240411"/>
            </section>
         </component>
